f33_vacask_dc_dec2: VACASK DC sweep mode="dec" points=2 from 1 to 5 runs 1, 2.23607, 5 (its AC law)
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
load "spice/capacitor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
model capacitor sp_capacitor
v1 (in 0) vsource dc=1.0 mag=1.0
r1 (in out) resistor r=1k
c1 (out 0) capacitor c=1u
control
  options rawfile="ascii"
  sweep s1 instance="v1" parameter="dc" from=1 to=5 mode="dec" points=2
    analysis ac1 op
endc
